      "system": {
        "active": true,
        "description": "<p class=\"feature\">Melee Attack Roll: +5, reach 5 ft. Hit: 6 (1d6 + 3) Piercing damage. If the target is a creature<span style=\"font-family:'Roboto Condensed', sans-serif\">, and the </span>stirge<span style=\"font-family:'Roboto Condensed', sans-serif\"> attaches to the target. While attached, the </span>stirge<span style=\"font-family:'Roboto Condensed', sans-serif\"> can't make Proboscis attacks, and the target takes 5 (2d4) Necrotic damage at the start of each of the </span>stirge's<span style=\"font-family:'Roboto Condensed', sans-serif\"> turns.</span></p><p class=\"feature\"><span style=\"font-family:'Roboto Condensed', sans-serif\">The </span>stirge<span style=\"font-family:'Roboto Condensed', sans-serif\"> can detach itself by spending 5 feet of its movement. The target or a creature within 5 feet of it can detach the </span>stirge<span style=\"font-family:'Roboto Condensed', sans-serif\"> as an action.</span></p>",
